{
  "schema": "ancora.parity.scenario.v1",
  "id": "s15-timetable-viewer",
  "title": "Timetable viewer (#121, PAR-092): the legacy public viewer across two users, authenticated only in Drupal",
  "notes": [
    "Issue #121 (legacy-parity-inventory.md PAR-092, Q-23, Q-37). The records and runs of s14: Alice with two plans, Bob with one, one run per period.",
    "The legacy characterization runs with public_viewer_anonymous = true in the disposable copy of the application (legacy_switches), so that its anonymous mode can be recorded too; the default is false.",
    "viewer_lists steps read the viewer's lists (get_browser_publico, get_public_treeBrigadas, get_public_list_profesores, _lugares, _otros_recursos) and explorer_grid steps with get_minibrowser_publico its grids; explorer-compare.php compares them with the Drupal timetable viewer (TimetableExplorer in viewer mode) in both engine modes.",
    "Steps marked \"drupal\": \"refused\" are answered by legacy and refused by Drupal: every anonymous request (the viewer is for logged-in users only until #62), and ids outside the user's lists (another user's other resource, a period that does not exist)."
  ],
